Instagram Signup 

Test Scenarios :-

1. Verify that a user can create an account using a valid email or mobile number.

2. Verify that the user can enter a valid username and password during signup.

3. Verify that the system displays an error when the user enters an already registered email or mobile number.

4. Verify that the user receives and can verify the OTP during signup.

5. Verify that the Instagram account is created successfully after entering all valid required details.
